{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "f37d8caa22bec7a06e91c8d0fde302c1771b039286ba5e67799de394c92693d2", "ja": "砲弾の暗躍", "zh": "炮弹的暗中行动", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e464d42e75bd708a5f56dc6ffa8fb72cfdbd45d9959f1972fedb0b4e4f100306", "ja": "式典にて、マツリは人間の国王を退位させ、\n自らの支配力をさらに強めようとしていた。\nミナコらと会場に潜入したセリカは、謎の\n集団と接触するタマキを目撃する。彼らは\n人間勢力のテロリスト『暁の砲弾』だった。", "zh": "在庆典上，茉莉逼迫人类国王退位，\n企图进一步加强自己的统治。\n与美奈子等人潜入会场的星梨花，目击了\n环正在与一个神秘集团接触。他们就是\n人类势力的恐怖分子“晓之炮弹”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_05_1000_robottoheisi", "source_sha256": "b2fdd16e2d1cd612d4c0c779315db03f7e5553b4e3aee1d79f154ef5971b554f", "ja": "これより警備を開始する。各自配置につけ。", "zh": "现在开始警戒。各就各位。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_05_1001_040tam", "source_sha256": "4a39759567e3d33a5c588cc023b915ae3d9926bf80e702a419fc73b1d7d52b1b", "ja": "（今日の式典にはマツリも来る。そろそろ『みんな』と\n合流しよう。私たちで、人間の地位を取り戻すんだ）", "zh": "（今天的典礼，茉莉也会来。差不多该和『大家』汇合了。我们要夺回人类的地位）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_05_1002_se", "source_sha256": "f3429af89e27de750bb10365669fbf893b1ae49fa9e869c54883abdadb34370d", "ja": "ザッ、ザッ、ザッ、ザッ……", "zh": "沙、沙、沙、沙……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_05_1003_020meg", "source_sha256": "0054042559e59433c15377cf11332518e026a7015985b8cbc2ad9e2c17a8acb3", "ja": "うわ、すごいロボットの数。\n都市じゅうのロボットが集まってない？", "zh": "哇，好多机器人啊。\n整个城市的机器人是不是都聚集过来了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_05_1004_004yuk", "source_sha256": "8d0467c749d9ebacfa32f8ef797e124ef4a82d7b1c5533d8d6b5227a0d71c32c", "ja": "きょろきょろしないで。\nメグミは前にあいつらとやり合ってるんですからね？", "zh": "别东张西望的。惠美可是之前和那些家伙交过手的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_05_1005_020meg", "source_sha256": "bba9f40840718c2f59e28a3c99c6a0f0eb368d925eb3d91b0b985f2ae642185c", "ja": "ユキホも盛大にぶっ放してたじゃん……\nあ、モモコはちゃんと隠れててね。", "zh": "雪步不也大开火了吗……啊，桃子要好好躲起来哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_05_1006_se", "source_sha256": "435ce737398bffec4133621c46ce5fc59eade8feec4083259c243735ceb23aa0", "ja": "ガション……ガチャガチャ！　ブシュウ……。", "zh": "咔嚓……哐当哐当！呲……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_05_1007_022ser", "source_sha256": "a2a35bfe493dc4bd0b1b624573bf3c39af6f088c692d0c2654b7e058b1da501f", "ja": "なんで私まで……。", "zh": "为什么连我也要……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_05_1008_019min", "source_sha256": "11a6a156a6ee59047372951d19e9ccdd03d43960669bf88c4530212ede2f6ecb", "ja": "式典に料理を出せるなんて名誉なことじゃないか。\n僕も屋台を隠れ蓑にできて助かったよ。", "zh": "能在典礼上提供料理，不是件很光荣的事嘛。\n我也多亏能用摊子当掩护，真是帮了大忙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_05_1009_022ser", "source_sha256": "3763298598438d068524f6b1887e26ef9edfa9ffd3559a24b1940eb7c8c08f04", "ja": "ほとんどロボットじゃない。\nぜんぜん売れないのに……。", "zh": "几乎都成机器人了。\n明明完全卖不出去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_05_1010_022ser", "source_sha256": "c54071a1bfa1d428d8e8ceaa11a0bc9e07f70cc18c08871a070cc30559915fb8", "ja": "え？　タマキ！？", "zh": "咦？环？！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_05_1011_020meg", "source_sha256": "0ae6c14ae9dfc7e56b6448dd16014f4d184d9e2f56969c99353438704b22aa3a", "ja": "なに？　今の、知り合い？", "zh": "怎么了？刚才那个，是你认识的人？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_05_1012_022ser", "source_sha256": "8d4d033656c485e4d50cbaab02c07be4cebb99c4e661c389c4511b7d58438ba7", "ja": "あ、あの……あっちにいるの、私の……っ！", "zh": "啊、那个……在那边的是我的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_05_1013_019min", "source_sha256": "b7a0f973af9964c553e26fb6de4523d3a33c457701eb1a6f794912b3f59387ae", "ja": "路地裏に入っていったね。\n何人かと合流したみたいだけど……。", "zh": "他走进小巷里了呢。\n好像还和几个人碰头了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_05_1014_020meg", "source_sha256": "f0f1ed16a7c7aa1e5810acf486b5f378ffee7a1a040fa852cd82a15c810e9de5", "ja": "！？　コトハ！？", "zh": "！？琴叶！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_05_1015_004yuk", "source_sha256": "4d3da5db9c9dc1383b528979fe6c8e80c29081cfc0cbc057b0178fd520ffdb7f", "ja": "えっ？　確かに、似てる人もいた気がしますけど、\nでも……。", "zh": "诶？确实，好像也有长得像的人，\n可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_05_1016_020meg", "source_sha256": "46fc0486306c019c6accb8f7ef679067387699613149f82098a417d6fcfa9cda", "ja": "あれはコトハだよ！　アタシが見間違えるわけない！", "zh": "那就是琴叶！我绝对不可能看错的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_05_1017_022ser", "source_sha256": "a0b9dba7b6479f4eb59752ef7d2b6b2af90b80babe0a65609c6fccc6df5ea85e", "ja": "タマキ、どうして……！？", "zh": "环，你怎么会……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_05_1018_019min", "source_sha256": "983449a72ed4cfc0181588fe1cad3e44830cbf95d3734cb303f8772e119055d7", "ja": "静かに。順番に話を聞こう。\n……セリカ、今の子は、君の友達？", "zh": "安静。我们一个一个听吧。\n……星梨花，这个孩子是你的朋友吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_05_1019_022ser", "source_sha256": "407f0efb875ba9b659d48efcf6b4ae9710cbe083f41b530a89a08c0fe8e3a69c", "ja": "うん……タマキっていって、ずっと一緒だったの。\nだけど……。", "zh": "嗯……她叫环，一直都和我在一起。\n但是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_05_1020_019min", "source_sha256": "603d015a72bc1d860405e077fa3d5d56f0cf8fa42bc701aa5dde33f778504974", "ja": "なるほど。二人を拾ってくれた人が連れ去られて、\nそれで衛兵にね。……メグミ、君のほうは？", "zh": "原来如此。收留你们两个人的人被带走了，然后你们就被卫兵……惠，你那边呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_05_1021_020meg", "source_sha256": "1aed7d6d63225b2b1c38db3bf1a9f40a5ed8a805b85512caeed0e04c5087aa96", "ja": "アタシも、友達。……死んだと思ってたんだけどね。", "zh": "我也是，被朋友带走的。……我还以为她死了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_05_1022_020meg", "source_sha256": "0a406d7180f155ec9ab9adc226cbaebdeb15373a8de6451b0b53dd706fdcabbf", "ja": "でも、他にも何人か見覚えがある。\nあれ……『暁の砲弾』じゃないかな？", "zh": "不过，我还认出其他几个人。\n咦……那不是“拂晓的炮弹”吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_05_1023_022ser", "source_sha256": "c22c0bf04bd2caec7bb1b43a326f74dd156cbe07c4ed1888564ccda550583a52", "ja": "『暁の砲弾』？", "zh": "『黎明的炮弹』？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_05_1024_004yuk", "source_sha256": "e0a372d3ca7434b3bca5a289e9be3b209fb4d3d77d9d62b703fa0aa58a4d16af", "ja": "反ロボットの地下組織です。\nメグミ、前に誘われたんだよね？", "zh": "是反机器人地下组织。\n惠美，你之前被邀请过吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_05_1025_020meg", "source_sha256": "3eab3638bc27c6236e5677a433fde0b8def0e9e2d69b3fb67a22984f55a6600c", "ja": "断ったけどね。なんか過激っぽいし……\nアタシは『相棒』があればいいしね。", "zh": "不过我拒绝了。总觉得有点太激进了……\n而且对我来说，只要有“搭档”就足够了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_05_1026_049mom", "source_sha256": "9a24224d0d8d9a6716a6aaa8c1d6d890955498f177a5426d72ef2361ee5a13e3", "ja": "む。モモコは？　いらない？", "zh": "唔。桃子呢？不需要吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_05_1027_020meg", "source_sha256": "e5f197009286a8ce89a98a915b748843a72267e7552624167e09e19d70593f1b", "ja": "あああ、ごめんごめん、いるいる！\n今はモモコも大事だよ！", "zh": "啊啊啊，对不起对不起，要的要的！\n现在桃子也很重要啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_05_1028_004yuk", "source_sha256": "7bacbcba250ff01cc148b88c1cd3c8c08da24d89a27384772c93fd321304affd", "ja": "けど、式典の日にあんな連中が集まってるなんて……\n不穏な気がします。", "zh": "不过，典礼当天居然聚集了那种人……总觉得有些不太妙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_05_1029_019min", "source_sha256": "8a4d474640cd0728e6862239b37c726b807f75a26cb82d9b40a8165eea525321", "ja": "何か仕掛けるつもりかもしれないね。\n……襲撃とか。", "zh": "说不定是打算搞什么行动。\n……比如袭击之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_05_1030_020meg", "source_sha256": "1766ed244c6ed1d1efd061041ece2861e3d8f41c494393d1c15e020003d5dedd", "ja": "ええっ！？　でもここにいるのはロボットだけじゃ\nないよ！？　これから国王だって来るんでしょ？", "zh": "诶！？可是这里不只有机器人吧！？国王也要过来的，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_05_1031_022ser", "source_sha256": "f0a0c9d48ba6c0630715c91c6ad0d15824e1e440e582d9e7f79338c01c2c6313", "ja": "まさか、タマキ……\nタマキがそんな人たちと関わってるってこと？", "zh": "难道说，环……你和那些人有来往吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_05_1032_019min", "source_sha256": "4d4b15993522823ba23409ca10da546ca94d076834f3828d6992f5b2746eb138", "ja": "わからないけど、何か目的があって……。\nそれで思い余ってしまったのかも。", "zh": "我也不知道，但她可能是有什么目的……\n所以一时冲动了也说不定。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_05_1033_022ser", "source_sha256": "0dbddf657f0b58dd9d315b3d6d30cbe578cceec3cc8519e042e64686af6782b5", "ja": "そんな……どうしよう、タマキにそんなこと\nさせたくないっ！", "zh": "怎么会……怎么办，我不想让环做那种事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_05_1034_019min", "source_sha256": "348643ab3b8eb8f1007a0362eecd46c8bbbfd39ff9274209bfbe8fcc56b3b9f7", "ja": "落ち着いて。僕に考えがある。\nみんな、手伝ってくれる？", "zh": "冷静下来。我有个想法。\n大家愿意帮忙吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
